[{"answer":"It's really good to see you, Tom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Since I had to give up work, I feel I'm losing touch with my friends and colleagues.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/2.mp3"},{"answer":"We really miss you in the office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/3.mp3"},{"answer":"We were all so sorry you had to leave.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/4.mp3"},{"answer":"But you must be relieved to have more time to look after your mother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/5.mp3"},{"answer":"How is she?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, she is very cheerful, but she needs a lot of help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you tried to get any support from the local council?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/8.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I didn't know I could.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they offer different kinds of practical support.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They realise that carers sometimes need time for all the other responsibilities they have,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/11.mp3"},{"answer":"apart from the person they're caring for,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and also that they sometimes need a break.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so tell me more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/15.mp3"},{"answer":"How do I go about getting this support?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you'd have to have an assessment of your mother's needs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/17.mp3"},{"answer":"That means someone would come round and talk to you about the situation and what you need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So, for a start, they'd want to know the amount of time you spend looking after your mother every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then they'll probably ask you what sorts of tasks you do for your mother during the day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Things like if she needs help with getting dressed, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I help her with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And also I help her get into the shower in the morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that sort of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/25.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll probably ask you if you do the shopping for her","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/26.mp3"},{"answer":"and help her at meal times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And whether she can cope using money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's becoming a bit of a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/29.mp3"},{"answer":"She used to be very good at it, but not anymore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/30.mp3"},{"answer":"And be ready to tell them about anything you find particularly difficult about caring for your mother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/31.mp3"},{"answer":"So, recently I've noticed she's started to have quite bad problems with her memory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/32.mp3"},{"answer":"If I wasn't there, I think she'd forget to eat, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And often she doesn't seem quite sure what day it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, tell them about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And are there any physical difficulties you have caring for her?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Lifting her, for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, she's quite heavy","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm afraid of hurting my back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd be in real trouble if that happened.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/40.mp3"},{"answer":"They can give you advice about that and also about how to avoid the possibility of your mum having a fall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/42.mp3"},{"answer":"So once they've done this assessment, if I'm eligible, what happens next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they might support you financially.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/44.mp3"},{"answer":"So they might help you with transport costs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/45.mp3"},{"answer":"like if you have to get a taxi to take your mother for an appointment, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I usually drive her myself, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/47.mp3"},{"answer":"So, could I claim for the petrol?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You could.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And you can claim for the insurance too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/51.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you need help with the housework, they can arrange for someone to come along once or twice a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And one other thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you don't mind me saying this, but it's important you look after yourself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And it seems to me you're under quite a bit of stress.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I am, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well tell the council because they may be able to give you some advice on how to minimise it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Though, actually, I feel so much better having talked to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll get in touch with the council straight away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, shall we go for coffee...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-2-2025-07-21-19-13-52/61.mp3"}]
